#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:2
msgid "Localization and Internationalization"
msgstr "本地化与国际化"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this article, we explain high-level approaches to internationalizing and "
"localizing your documentation."
msgstr "本文介绍对文档进行国际化和本地化的高层方法。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:6
msgid ""
"By default, Read the Docs assumes that your documentation is or *might "
"become* multilingual one day. The initial default language is English and "
"therefore you often see the initial build of your documentation published at"
" ``/en/latest/``, where the ``/en`` denotes that it's in English. By having "
"the ``en`` URL component present from the beginning, you are ready for the "
"eventuality that you would want a second language."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Read the Docs 假设你的文档是或*将来可能成为* 多语言的。初始默认语言为英语，因此你常会看到文档的首次构建发布在 "
"``/en/latest/`` ，其中 ``/en`` 表示英语。从一开始就包含 ``en`` 这一 URL "
"片段，可让你在未来需要第二种语言时从容应对。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:13
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports hosting your documentation in multiple languages. "
"Read below for the various approaches that we support."
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持以多种语言托管你的文档。我们支持的各种方式见下文。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:20
msgid "Projects with one language"
msgstr "单语言项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:22
msgid ""
"If your documentation isn't in English (the default), you should indicate "
"which language you have written it in."
msgstr "如果你的文档不是英语（默认语言），应指明你所使用的语言。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:25
msgid ""
"It is easy to set the language of your project. In your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings` (or when adding the project), simply select your "
"desired :guilabel:`Language` from the dropdown. This will tell Read the Docs"
" that your project is in the language. The language will be represented in "
"the URL for your project."
msgstr ""
"设置项目语言很简单。在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings` （或添加项目时），只需从下拉框中选择所需的 "
":guilabel:`Language` 。这会告知 Read the Docs 项目所用语言。语言会体现在项目 URL 中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:31
msgid ""
"For example, a project that is in Spanish will have a default URL of "
"``/es/latest/`` instead of ``/en/latest/``."
msgstr "例如，西班牙语项目的默认 URL 为 ``/es/latest/`` 而非 ``/en/latest/`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:35
msgid "Projects with multiple translations"
msgstr "多翻译项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:39
msgid ":doc:`guides/manage-translations-sphinx`"
msgstr ":doc:`guides/manage-translations-sphinx`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:40
msgid ""
"Describes the whole process for a Sphinx documentation projects with "
"multiples languages in the same repository and how to keep the translations "
"updated on time."
msgstr "介绍在同一仓库中管理多语言 Sphinx 文档项目的完整流程，以及如何让翻译及时更新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:43
msgid ""
"Each language must have its own project on Read the Docs. You will choose "
"one to be the parent project, and add each of the other projects as "
"\"Translations\" of the parent project."
msgstr "每种语言都必须在 Read the Docs 上有独立项目。你需指定其中一个作为父项目，并将其他项目添加为父项目的\"翻译\"。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:47
msgid "Let's use ``godot`` as an example."
msgstr "以 ``godot`` 为例。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:49
msgid ""
"The ``godot`` project is the parent. Each translation then has its own "
"project, for example ``godot-es``. The *Language* for ``godot-es`` is set to"
" ``Spanish``. Then, on the  *Translations* page of the ``godot`` project, "
"``godot-es`` is set as translation."
msgstr ""
"``godot`` 项目为父项目。每个翻译随后有独立项目，例如 ``godot-es`` 。``godot-es`` 的*语言* 设为 "
"``Spanish`` 。然后在 ``godot`` 项目的* 翻译* 页面中，将 ``godot-es`` 设为翻译。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:54
msgid "This has the results of serving:"
msgstr "这样提供服务的结果是："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:56
msgid "``godot`` at ``https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/``"
msgstr "``godot`` 位于 ``https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:57
msgid "``godot-es`` at ``https://docs.godotengine.org/es/stable/``"
msgstr "``godot-es`` 位于 ``https://docs.godotengine.org/es/stable/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:59
msgid "It also gets included in the Read the Docs :term:`flyout menu`:"
msgstr "它也会包含在 Read the Docs 的 :term:`flyout menu` 中："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:64
msgid ""
"The default language of a custom domain is determined by the language of the"
" parent project that the domain was configured on. See :doc:`/custom-"
"domains` for more information."
msgstr "自定义域名的默认语言由配置该域名的父项目语言决定。更多信息见 :doc:`/custom-domains` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:70
msgid "Translation workflows"
msgstr "翻译工作流"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:72
msgid ""
"When you work with translations, the workflow of your translators becomes a "
"critical component."
msgstr "使用翻译时，译者的工作流成为关键环节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:75
msgid "Considerations include:"
msgstr "需要考虑："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:77
msgid ""
"Are your translators able to use a Git workflow? For instance, are they able"
" to translate directly via GitHub?"
msgstr "你的译者能否使用 Git 工作流？例如，他们能否直接通过 GitHub 翻译？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:78
msgid "Do you benefit from machine translation?"
msgstr "机器翻译对你是否有帮助？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:79
msgid ""
"Do you need different roles, for instance do you need translators and "
"editors?"
msgstr "你是否需要不同角色，例如译者与审校？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:80
msgid "What is your source language?"
msgstr "你的源语言是什么？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:81
msgid "When are your translated versions published?"
msgstr "翻译版本何时发布？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:83
msgid ""
"There are many translation platforms that support this workflow. These "
"include:"
msgstr "许多翻译平台支持此工作流，包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:86
msgid "`Weblate <https://weblate.org/>`_"
msgstr "`Weblate <https://weblate.org/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:87
msgid "`Transifex <https://www.transifex.com/>`_"
msgstr "`Transifex <https://www.transifex.com/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:88
msgid "`Crowdin <https://crowdin.com/>`_"
msgstr "`Crowdin <https://crowdin.com/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/localization.rst:90
msgid ""
"Because Read the Docs builds your Git repository, you can use any of the "
"above solutions. Any solution that synchronizes your translations with your "
"Git repository will ensure that your translations are automatically "
"published with Read the Docs."
msgstr ""
"由于 Read the Docs 构建你的 Git 仓库，你可以使用上述任一方案。任何能将翻译与 Git 仓库同步的方案，都能确保翻译随 Read "
"the Docs 自动发布。"

